data: {"id": "c84e6f9c1a7647d1-thinking-parallel_evidence-154", "run_id": "c84e6f9c1a7647d1", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "好，代码已经采集了 Metrics、Logging 和 Tracing 的首轮基线。现在我需要执行 K8s 描述和 Topology 查询来补充生命周期和拓扑事实，并查看 Previous Logs 以确认崩溃原因。\n\n1. **kubectl_describe**: 确认 Pod 当前状态、Last State、Exit Code、重启次数和事件。\n2. **kubectl_previous_logs**: 获取崩溃前的容器日志，寻找 Exit/Reason 原文。\n3. **query_pod_topology**: 确认控制器、Service、节点关系。\n\n先并行执行这三项：\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1788472038501, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

