data: {"id": "c84e6f9c1a7647d1-thinking-parallel_evidence-1191", "run_id": "c84e6f9c1a7647d1", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "已采集事实、冲突与缺口（aiops-case-10/workload-79d9f8fd88-sbqvc）\n\n- 实体身份与生命周期\n  - Pod aiops-case-10/workload-79d9f8fd88-sbqvc，UID b1c01c93-0091-4506-bcbd-69cfd75e0f12，调度在 node2/10.2.0.50，IP 172.16.104.31；属于 ReplicaSet workload-79d9f8fd88，服务标记为 aiops-lab-workload。\n  - Pod phase=Running，但 Ready/ContainersReady=False，Reason=ContainersNotReady。container app 状态：ready=False，restarts=33，exitCode=137，Reason=CrashLoopBackOff，消息含“back-off 5m0s”。\n  - 结论：Pod 当前仍处于 CrashLoopBackOff 异常状态，尚未恢复。\n\n- 事件证据（kubectl_events / ku", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1788472094265, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

