踪数据表明，异常前应用均正常响应 200 请求且无应用日志报错（证据 6、7），进一步排除了业务逻辑故障，将根因锁定在硬性的极低内存上限上。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n内存硬限制过低(96Mi) → Python进程触发内核OOMKiller → 容器进程被强杀(SIGKILL/退出码137) → CrashLoopBackOff\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为：Pod `workload-79d9f8fd88-sbqvc` 中 `app` 容器被配置了极低且不足以支撑 Python 运行的内存硬限制（96Mi），导致内核 OOMKiller 频繁终止容器。\n\n- **现象支撑**：容器持续触发 CrashLoopBackOff（fact-64b295a56601），重启次数达 33 次（fact-2b5f91070cbe）。\n- **机制支撑**：容器退出码为 137，表明被系统信号强杀（fact-4feda419abfc）；Kubernetes Event 中记录 Exit Code 137（fact-6699d89dd8fe）。\n- **配置支撑**：内存限制被固定为 96Mi（fact-00ece17adfd8）。\n- **排除干扰**：应用日志（fact-09717ab98082）和 HTTP 追踪（fact-720b5f52748e）均在终止前显示 HTTP 200 正常响应，排除应用层报错导致的崩溃。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 2.5m\n├─ 问题定位: 21.2s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 112.6s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-10/workload-79d9f8fd88-sbqvc: 112.6s (Evidence 106.4s, RCA 6.0s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 15.3s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-10/workload-79d9f8fd88-sbqvc**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 149.178, "metrics": {"run_id": "c84e6f9c1a7647d1", "mttr": {"value": "2.5m", "seconds": 149.18512082099915, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果